        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4ec043147a3d4d769139457cd1822fa5",
      "statement": "Each isolate has a V8 heap limit separate from the node memory (default 128 MB, CELLD_V8_HEAP_LIMIT_MB); an isolate above 90% of the limit refuses a new hibernatable WebSocket and stops materializing a SQL result set, and serves again when use falls under 75% of the limit.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L297-L311",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a1c9ea044d529a2baafcecf5ecccf0075022aba71c120758c9c45547f925cb46:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8ab7996d23fa4c74b7cdfdf69f799776",
      "statement": "celld admits a maximum of 64 concurrent fetch events for one Durable Object or Queue broker (CELLD_MAX_CELL_REQUESTS) and returns HTTP 503 with Retry-After: 1 and X-Celld-Overload: cell when the target is saturated, logging a cell_overload_refused event.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/README.md#L638-L656",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2e63f958d5cae0a1ba5a200dab3e749f888c31005e2e11a0f0d573bdda3de89a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a7de7177266e4d72b1ee3a32f610ae25",
      "statement": "The outbound-WebSocket pin budget is node-wide, counted in pinned cells, and capped at 50% of the resident ceiling so a resource walk down always has an evictable victim.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/logic/pressure.rs#L279-L297",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:60195fc8b11e1095605a249dc39ab2c320dfe34d37ec01972d3c695705fec658:"
